t friends are gonna be  the ones who try to help you and find  ways for you to get to your goal in  aren't the ones who see you struggle and  say you see I told you so  you shouldn't have done that that was  stupid that's not a real friend  so stop caring about what your friends  think and do this for you how I would  handle this situation if I was picking  between online marketing is a biz  and finish in my school I would prove it  to myself I would prove to myself that I  really love this thing you know you're  saying that you can't be an online  marketer part-time of course you can  that's what most of these guys got  started this is the business to be in  part-time that get started  prove to yourself that if you spent one  hour a day okay one hour a day working  on your online marketing business prove  yourself two things okay one that you  are making money doing this right you're  gonna make money doing this and two that  you love doing this I don't want you to  leave your school leave your job jump  into this thing that you thought you  were gonna like and then it's not what  you thought at all and you hate it and  you have to go back and get back into  school and go back and get that job  prove to yourself try it every day one  hour get results show that you like it  show that you this is the path for you  and when you feel it then you can make  the decision you know what this this  this is okay I'm gonna be okay I'm gonna  follow this path and I'll be successful  and if you can't make it work off to the  one hour a day and you start hating it  then you know that that's not the path  for you either and probably this  paralegal thing to be honest it's not  gonna work out for you because you're  already drifting you're still in school  you're still trying to figure out what  you're gonna do you're drifting if your  mind is drifting to something else then  what you're doing right now is not the  path that's gonna support you and maybe  it's online marketing mayb